    "id": null,
    "uid": "copilot-otel-opensource",
    "title": "GitHub Copilot \u2014 OTel (Open Source Stack)",
    "description": "GitHub Copilot agent and chat telemetry via OpenTelemetry GenAI semantic conventions. Tracks token usage, latency, model adoption, tool calls, errors, and includes trace and log drill-down for debugging individual Copilot interactions. Backed by VictoriaMetrics (metrics), Tempo (traces), and Loki (logs) \u2014 no Azure Monitor / Application Insights dependency.",
    "tags": [
      "copilot",
      "genai",
      "opentelemetry",
      "otel",
      "victoriametrics",
      "tempo",
      "loki"
    ],
    "timezone": "browser",
    "schemaVersion": 39,
    "version": 1,
    "refresh": "1m",
    "time": {
      "from": "now-7d",
      "to": "now"
    },
    "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
    "graphTooltip": 1,
    "templating": {
      "list": [
        {
          "name": "DS_VM",
          "type": "datasource",
          "query": "prometheus",
          "current": {
            "selected": false,
            "text": "VictoriaMetrics",
            "value": "${DS_VICTORIAMETRICS}"
          },
          "hide": 0,
          "label": "Metrics datasource"
        },
        {
          "name": "DS_TEMPO_VAR",
          "type": "datasource",
          "query": "tempo",
          "current": {
            "selected": false,
            "text": "Tempo",
            "value": "${DS_TEMPO}"
          },
          "hide": 0,
          "label": "Traces datasource"
        },
        {
          "name": "DS_LOKI_VAR",
          "type": "datasource",
          "query": "loki",
          "current": {
            "selected": false,
            "text": "Loki",
            "value": "${DS_LOKI}"
          },
          "hide": 0,
          "label": "Logs datasource"
        },
        {
          "name": "model",
          "type": "query",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_VM}"
          },
          "query": "label_values(gen_ai_client_token_usage_sum, gen_ai_request_model)",
          "refresh": 2,
          "multi": true,
          "includeAll": true,
          "current": {
            "selected": true,
            "text": "All",
            "value": "$__all"
          },
          "label": "Model"
        },
        {
          "name": "service_name",
          "type": "query",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_VM}"
          },
          "query": "label_values(gen_ai_client_token_usage_sum, service_name)",
          "refresh": 2,
          "multi": true,
          "includeAll": true,
          "current": {
            "selected": true,
            "text": "All",
            "value": "$__all"
          },
          "label": "Service"
        }
      ]
    },
    "panels": [
      {
        "id": 999,
        "type": "text",
        "title": "How to Use This Dashboard",
        "gridPos": {
          "h": 9,
          "w": 24,
          "x": 0,
          "y": 0
        },
        "options": {
          "mode": "markdown",
          "content": "## How to use this dashboard\n\n**What this shows:** GitHub Copilot agent and chat telemetry, captured via OpenTelemetry GenAI semantic conventions, flowing through our open-source pipeline (VS Code &rarr; OTel Collector &rarr; RedPanda &rarr; OTel Router &rarr; VictoriaMetrics / Tempo / Loki) with **no Azure Monitor or Application Insights** in the path.\n\n**Filters (top of dashboard):**\n- **Model** &mdash; filter all panels to one or more specific models (e.g. `claude-opus-4-6`, `gpt-4o-mini`). Defaults to All.\n- **Service** &mdash; filter by `service.name` (useful if multiple teams/services emit Copilot telemetry separately). Defaults to All.\n- Use the time picker (top right) to change the reporting window &mdash; all rate/increase queries respect this range automatically.\n\n**Section guide:**\n| Section | What it tells you |\n|---|---|\n| Agent Summary Statistics | High-level volume: total operations, tokens in/out, average response time |\n| Chat & Tool Summary | Breakdown of LLM calls vs. chat sessions vs. tool calls, plus latency (TTFT) and error rate |\n| Usage Over Time | Trend of operation volume and token consumption per model, over time |\n| Model Performance | Which models are used most, and how each compares on latency (Avg/P90 duration, P50/P90 time-to-first-token) |\n| Cost & Tokens | Input vs. output token trend and an **estimated** cost table &mdash; update the per-token rate in the panel query to match your actual contract pricing |\n| Errors | Error volume by type, plus a live tail of error-level log events |\n| Logs | Raw OTel log event stream (`user_prompt`, `tool_result`, `api_request`, etc.) for any session |\n| Trace Drill-Down | Search recent traces and inspect individual spans &mdash; use this to debug a *specific* slow or failed Copilot interaction |\n\n**Drilling into a single interaction:**\n1. Go to the **Trace Drill-Down** section.\n2. Use the table to find the trace (filter by time, model, or service).\n3. Click a trace row &mdash; it opens in the trace detail panel below, showing every span (`chat`, `execute_tool`, `invoke_agent`) with their `gen_ai.*` attributes and exact timing.\n\n**If a panel shows \"No data\":**\n- Check the Model/Service filters aren't excluding everything.\n- Confirm the underlying metric/label names match your pipeline (see the accompanying KQL&rarr;PromQL/LogQL/TraceQL migration reference).\n- Confirm VS Code clients have `github.copilot.chat.otel.enabled` and `otlpEndpoint` configured and have been restarted.\n\n*Each panel below also has its own description &mdash; hover the (i) icon in the panel header for details on what it queries and why.*\n"
        },
        "transparent": false
      },
      {
        "id": 100,
        "type": "row",
        "title": "Agent Summary Statistics",
        "gridPos": {
          "h": 1,
          "w": 24,
          "x": 0,
          "y": 9
        },
        "collapsed": false,
        "panels": []
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "type": "stat",
        "title": "Total Operations",
        "gridPos": {
          "h": 4,
          "w": 6,
          "x": 0,
          "y": 10
        },
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${DS_VM}"
        },
        "targets": [
          {
            "expr": "sum(increase(gen_ai_operation_count_total{gen_ai_request_model=~\"$model\", service_name=~\"$service_name\"}[$__range]))",
            "legendFormat": "Total Operations"
          }
        ],
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": {
            "color": {
              "mode": "fixed",
              "fixedColor": "#3B82E6"
            },
            "decimals": 0,
            "unit": "short"
          },
          "overrides": []
        },
        "options": {
          "reduceOptions": {
            "calcs": [
              "lastNotNull"
            ]
          },
          "colorMode": "background",
          "graphMode": "none",
          "justifyMode": "auto",
          "textMode": "value_and_name"
        },
        "description": "Total count of all Copilot operations (chat, tool calls, agent invocations) in the selected time range. Source: gen_ai.client.operation.duration count, summed across all operation types."
      },
      {
        "id": 2,
        "type": "stat",
        "title": "Total Input Tokens",
        "gridPos": {
          "h": 4,
          "w": 6,
          "x": 6,
          "y": 10
        },
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${DS_VM}"
        },
        "targets": [
          {
            "expr": "sum(increase(gen_ai_usage_input_tokens_total{gen_ai_request_model=~\"$model\", service_name=~\"$service_name\"}[$__range]))",
            "legendFormat": "Total Input Tokens"
          }
        ],
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": {
            "color": {
              "mode": "fixed",
              "fixedColor": "#9C5FE0"
            },
            "decimals": 1,
            "unit": "short"
          },
          "overrides": []
        },
        "options": {
          "reduceOptions": {
            "calcs": [
              "lastNotNull"
            ]
          },
          "colorMode": "background",
          "graphMode": "none",
          "justifyMode": "auto",
          "textMode": "value_and_name"
        },
        "description": "Total prompt/input tokens sent to all models in the selected range. Source: gen_ai.usage.input_tokens. Drives most of your token cost \u2014 watch for spikes from large context windows."
      },
      {
        "id": 3,
        "type": "stat",
        "title": "Total Output Tokens",
        "gridPos": {
          "h": 4,
          "w": 6,
          "x": 12,
          "y": 10
        },
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${DS_VM}"
        },
        "targets": [
          {
            "expr": "sum(increase(gen_ai_usage_output_tokens_total{gen_ai_request_model=~\"$model\", service_name=~\"$service_name\"}[$__range]))",
            "legendFormat": "Total Output Tokens"
          }
        ],
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": {
            "color": {
              "mode": "fixed",
              "fixedColor": "#5BA85B"
            },
            "decimals": 0,
            "unit": "short"
          },
          "overrides": []
        },
        "options": {
          "reduceOptions": {
            "calcs": [
              "lastNotNull"
            ]
          },
          "colorMode": "background",
          "graphMode": "none",
          "justifyMode": "auto",
          "textMode": "value_and_name"
        },
        "description": "Total completion/output tokens generated by all models in the selected range. Source: gen_ai.usage.output_tokens. Typically priced higher per-token than input."
      },
      {
        "id": 4,
        "type": "stat",
        "title": "Avg Response Time",
        "gridPos": {
          "h": 4,
          "w": 6,
          "x": 18,
          "y": 10
        },
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${DS_VM}"
        },
        "targets": [
          {
            "expr": "avg(rate(gen_ai_client_operation_duration_seconds_sum{gen_ai_request_model=~\"$model\", service_name=~\"$service_name\"}[$__range]) / rate(gen_ai_client_operation_duration_seconds_count{gen_ai_request_model=~\"$model\", service_name=~\"$service_name\"}[$__range]))",
            "legendFormat": "Avg Response Time"
          }
        ],
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": {
            "color": {
              "mode": "fixed",
              "fixedColor": "#F0954A"
            },
            "decimals": 2,
            "unit": "s"
          },
          "overrides": []
        },
        "options": {
          "reduceOptions": {
            "calcs": [
              "lastNotNull"
            ]
          },
          "colorMode": "background",
          "graphMode": "none",
          "justifyMode": "auto",
          "textMode": "value_and_name"
        },
        "description": "Average end-to-end response time across all operations and models. Source: gen_ai.client.operation.duration. A rising trend here often means model overload or network latency upstream."
      },
      {
        "id": 101,
        "type": "row",
        "title": "Chat & Tool Summary",
        "gridPos": {
          "h": 1,
          "w": 24,
          "x": 0,
          "y": 14
        },
        "collapsed": false,
        "panels": []
      },
      {
        "id": 5,
        "type": "stat",
        "title": "LLM Calls",
        "gridPos": {
          "h": 4,
          "w": 5,
          "x": 0,
          "y": 15
        },
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${DS_VM}"
        },
        "targets": [
          {
            "expr": "sum(increase(gen_ai_client_operation_duration_seconds_count{gen_ai_operation_name=\"chat\", gen_ai_request_model=~\"$model\", service_name=~\"$service_name\"}[$__range]))",
            "legendFormat": "LLM Calls"
          }
        ],
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": {
            "color": {
              "mode": "fixed",
              "fixedColor": "#3B82E6"
            },
            "decimals": 2,
            "unit": "short"
          },
          "overrides": []
        },
        "options": {
          "reduceOptions": {
            "calcs": [
              "lastNotNull"
            ]
          },
          "colorMode": "background",
          "graphMode": "none",
          "justifyMode": "auto",
          "textMode": "value_and_name"
        },
        "description": "Count of LLM (chat completion) calls specifically \u2014 excludes tool calls and agent invocations. Source: gen_ai.client.operation.duration count filtered to operation.name = 'chat'."
      },
      {
        "id": 6,
        "type": "stat",
        "title": "Chat Sessions",
        "gridPos": {
          "h": 4,
          "w": 5,
          "x": 5,
          "y": 15
        },
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${DS_VM}"
        },
        "targets": [
          {
            "expr": "sum(increase(gen_ai_chat_session_count_total{service_name=~\"$service_name\"}[$__range]))",
            "legendFormat": "Chat Sessions"
          }
        ],
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": {
            "color": {
              "mode": "fixed",
              "fixedColor": "#5BA85B"
            },
            "decimals": 0,
            "unit": "short"
          },
          "overrides": []
        },
        "options": {
          "reduceOptions": {
            "calcs": [
              "lastNotNull"
            ]
          },
          "colorMode": "background",
          "graphMode": "none",
          "justifyMode": "auto",
          "textMode": "value_and_name"
        },
        "description": "Number of distinct Copilot Chat sessions opened in the selected range. One session can contain many LLM calls and tool calls."
      },
      {
        "id": 7,
        "type": "stat",
        "title": "Tool Calls",
        "gridPos": {
          "h": 4,
          "w": 5,
          "x": 10,
          "y": 15
        },
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${DS_VM}"
        },
        "targets": [
          {
            "expr": "sum(increase(gen_ai_tool_call_count_total{service_name=~\"$service_name\"}[$__range]))",
            "legendFormat": "Tool Calls"
          }
        ],
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": {
            "color": {
              "mode": "fixed",
              "fixedColor": "#9C5FE0"
            },
            "decimals": 0,
            "unit": "short"
          },
          "overrides": []
        },
        "options": {
          "reduceOptions": {
            "calcs": [
              "lastNotNull"
            ]
          },
          "colorMode": "background",
          "graphMode": "none",
          "justifyMode": "auto",
          "textMode": "value_and_name"
        },
        "description": "Count of tool/function invocations triggered by Copilot (e.g. file edits, terminal commands, MCP tool calls). High tool-call counts relative to chat calls indicate agentic workflows, not just Q&A."
      },
      {
        "id": 8,
        "type": "stat",
        "title": "Avg TTFT",
        "gridPos": {
          "h": 4,
          "w": 4,
          "x": 15,
          "y": 15
        },
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${DS_VM}"
        },
        "targets": [
          {
            "expr": "avg(rate(gen_ai_server_time_to_first_token_seconds_sum{gen_ai_request_model=~\"$model\", service_name=~\"$service_name\"}[$__range]) / rate(gen_ai_server_time_to_first_token_seconds_count{gen_ai_request_model=~\"$model\", service_name=~\"$service_name\"}[$__range]))",
            "legendFormat": "Avg TTFT"
          }
        ],
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": {
            "color": {
              "mode": "fixed",
              "fixedColor": "#F0954A"
            },
            "decimals": 2,
            "unit": "s"
          },
          "overrides": []
        },
        "options": {
          "reduceOptions": {
            "calcs": [
              "lastNotNull"
            ]
          },
          "colorMode": "background",
          "graphMode": "none",
          "justifyMode": "auto",
          "textMode": "value_and_name"
        },
        "description": "Average Time To First Token \u2014 how long a user waits before seeing the first streamed response token. This is the latency users actually feel; track separately from total duration."
      },
      {
        "id": 9,
        "type": "stat",
        "title": "Error Rate",
        "gridPos": {
          "h": 4,
          "w": 5,
          "x": 19,
          "y": 15
        },
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${DS_VM}"
        },
        "targets": [
          {
            "expr": "100 * sum(increase(gen_ai_client_operation_duration_seconds_count{error_type!=\"\", gen_ai_request_model=~\"$model\", service_name=~\"$service_name\"}[$__range])) / sum(increase(gen_ai_client_operation_duration_seconds_count{gen_ai_request_model=~\"$model\", service_name=~\"$service_name\"}[$__range]))",
            "legendFormat": "Error Rate"
          }
        ],
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": {
            "color": {
              "mode": "thresholds"
            },
            "decimals": 1,
            "unit": "percent",
            "thresholds": {
              "mode": "absolute",
              "steps": [
                {
                  "color": "#5BA85B",
                  "value": null
                },
                {
                  "color": "#F0954A",
                  "value": 2
                },
                {
                  "color": "#E0524A",
                  "value": 5
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "overrides": []
        },
        "options": {
          "reduceOptions": {
            "calcs": [
              "lastNotNull"
            ]
          },
          "colorMode": "background",
          "graphMode": "none",
          "justifyMode": "auto",
          "textMode": "value_and_name"
        },
        "description": "Percentage of operations that resulted in an error (any error_type). Thresholds: green < 2%, amber 2-5%, red > 5%. Investigate spikes via the Errors section below."
      },
      {
        "id": 102,
        "type": "row",
        "title": "Usage Over Time",
        "gridPos": {
          "h": 1,
          "w": 24,
          "x": 0,
          "y": 19
        },
        "collapsed": false,
        "panels": []
      },
      {
        "id": 10,
        "type": "barchart",
        "title": "Operations Over Time",
        "description": "Count of chat, execute_tool, and invoke_agent operations, stacked by type",
        "gridPos": {
          "h": 9,
          "w": 12,
          "x": 0,
          "y": 20
        },
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${DS_VM}"
        },
        "targets": [
          {
            "expr": "sum by (gen_ai_operation_name) (increase(gen_ai_client_operation_duration_seconds_count{gen_ai_operation_name=\"chat\", gen_ai_request_model=~\"$model\", service_name=~\"$service_name\"}[1d]))",
            "legendFormat": "Count chat"
          },
          {
            "expr": "sum by (gen_ai_operation_name) (increase(gen_ai_client_operation_duration_seconds_count{gen_ai_operation_name=\"execute_tool\", service_name=~\"$service_name\"}[1d]))",
            "legendFormat": "Count execute_tool"
          },
          {
            "expr": "sum by (gen_ai_operation_name) (increase(gen_ai_client_operation_duration_seconds_count{gen_ai_operation_name=\"invoke_agent\", service_name=~\"$service_name\"}[1d]))",
            "legendFormat": "Count invoke_agent"
          }
        ],
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": {
            "custom": {
              "stacking": {
                "mode": "normal"
              }
            }
          },
          "overrides": [
            {
              "matcher": {
                "id": "byName",
                "options": "Count chat"
              },
              "properties": [
                {
                  "id": "color",
                  "value": {
                    "mode": "fixed",
                    "fixedColor": "#5BA85B"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "matcher": {
                "id": "byName",
                "options": "Count execute_tool"
              },
              "properties": [
                {
                  "id": "color",
                  "value": {
                    "mode": "fixed",
                    "fixedColor": "#E8C547"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "matcher": {
                "id": "byName",
                "options": "Count invoke_agent"
              },
              "properties": [
                {
                  "id": "color",
                  "value": {
                    "mode": "fixed",
                    "fixedColor": "#5B8FE0"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "legend": {
            "displayMode": "table",
            "placement": "bottom",
            "calcs": [
              "sum"
            ]
          },
          "tooltip": {
            "mode": "multi"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": 11,
        "type": "barchart",
        "title": "Token Consumption Over Time by Model",
        "description": "Total tokens (input + output) consumed per model over time",
        "gridPos": {
